Impersonation Level:		Impersonation

New Logon:
	Security ID:		S-1-5-18
	Account Name:		DC01$
	Account Domain:		CORP.LOCAL
	Logon ID:		0x696B82D
	Linked Logon ID:		0x0
	Network Account Name:	-
	Network Account Domain:	-
	Logon GUID:		{f422cadb-0089-08ef-07d9-7c4520a027f9}

Process Information:
	Process ID:		0x0
	Process Name:		-

